sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Platform
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Operator as mlflow-operator<br/>MLflowReconciler
    participant Helm as Helm Chart Renderer
    participant Kubelet as Kubelet
    participant MLflow as MLflow Deployment<br/>8080/TCP
    participant Gateway as Platform Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Prom as Prometheus
    participant MetricsSvc as Metrics Service<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS

    Note over User,MLflow: Flow 1: MLflow Instance Provisioning

    User->>K8sAPI: Create MLflow CR<br/>Auth: Bearer token / kubeconfig
    K8sAPI->>Operator: Watch notification<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    Operator->>Helm: Render chart with CR spec values
    Helm-->>Operator: Rendered manifests
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create child resources<br/>(Deployment, Service, PVC, HTTPRoute,<br/>ConsoleLink, ServiceMonitor, CronJobs)
    K8sAPI->>Kubelet: Schedule MLflow Deployment<br/>Auth: Node certificate

    Note over Prom,MetricsSvc: Flow 2: Metrics Collection

    Prom->>MetricsSvc: GET /metrics<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS<br/>TLS (service-ca)
    MetricsSvc->>MetricsSvc: TokenReview +<br/>SubjectAccessReview
    MetricsSvc-->>Prom: Metrics response

    Note over User,MLflow: Flow 3: External Access via Gateway

    User->>Gateway: HTTPS request<br/>443/TCP TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Platform auth
    Gateway->>MLflow: Forward via HTTPRoute<br/>8080/TCP<br/>Auth: self_subject_access_review
    MLflow-->>Gateway: Response
    Gateway-->>User: HTTPS response
